[1.0.55]
* Bump [Skyvern 1.0.55](https://github.com/Skyvern-AI/skyvern/releases/tag/v1.0.55).
* Start on Cloudron: keep the UI bundle and Skyvern temp dir on writable storage, and exclude only `/api` from proxyauth so the platform nginx config stays valid.
* Serve remote MCP as its own process and publish it at `/api/mcp/`. The API process does not mount `/mcp`.
* Keep `/api/mcp/` on the MCP server path. A trailing slash was redirected to the container's loopback address.

[1.0.36]
* Initial Cloudron package for Skyvern 1.0.36: PostgreSQL, local storage, proxyauth, nginx routes for the UI, API, MCP, and artifacts.
